WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/layout/status-bar/LiveTelemetrySegment.tsx — a DENSE single-line footer status-bar segment
  mirroring the SSE/MQTT pipeline freshness from `useLiveConnection()` (prompt data sources: useTranslation +
  useLiveConnection; shared components used: @/components/ui; charts/maps: none). Composition:
    container  : <Tooltip side=top><Link to="/signal-diff" aria-label=ariaLabel className="inline-flex … text-[11px]">
    dot        : <span h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full> tone-colored, STATIC (no animation in this segment), aria-hidden
    icon       : <Icon h-3 w-3>, Loader2 `animate-spin` ONLY for reconnecting; aria-hidden
    label      : if !iconOnly → <span font-medium>{short}</span> + (connected && lastMessageAt ? <span text-muted>· {age}</span>)
    variants (web `cfg[status]`, VERBATIM):
      connected    → Wifi    · emerald (text-emerald-300 / bg-emerald-400 dot) · short t('statusBar.live.short','Live')
      reconnecting → Loader2 · amber   (text-amber-300 / bg-amber-400)         · short t('…reconnecting','Reconnecting') · spin
      disconnected → WifiOff · rose    (text-rose-300 / bg-rose-400)           · short t('…offline','Offline')
      unknown      → WifiOff · muted   (text-[var(--text-muted)] / surface-2)  · short t('…unknown','Idle')
    ageSecondsLabel (VERBATIM): null/!finite/neg → "—"; sec<60 → "Xs"; min<60 → "Xm"; else "Xh" (each floored)
    tooltipBody : connected ? "{tooltip} · {lastMessage(age)}" : "{tooltip} · {short}"
    ariaLabel   : "{aria}: {short}"   ·   prop iconOnly:Bool=false
  Extracted i18n keys (7): statusBar.live.{short, reconnecting, offline, unknown, tooltip, lastMessage, aria}. The
                            i18next `{{age}}` token in lastMessage → printf `%@` for String(format:).

